  - SectionId: 89308091
    EntryId: 37999102
    Key: howto.title
    Value: HOW TO PLAY
  - SectionId: 89308091
    EntryId: 32644992
    Key: howto.l1
    Value: Everyone controls one limb of the body.
  - SectionId: 89308091
    EntryId: 26149491
    Key: howto.l2
    Value: "MOUSE \u2014 move your hand / foot"
  - SectionId: 89308091
    EntryId: 36193593
    Key: howto.l3
    Value: "LEFT CLICK \u2014 grab the rock under the cursor"
  - SectionId: 89308091
    EntryId: 95328796
    Key: howto.l4
    Value: 'After grabbing, control passes to the other hand: reach up, click, repeat!'
  - SectionId: 89308091
    EntryId: 73969794
    Key: howto.l5
    Value: "Q / E / A / D \u2014 select limb  \xB7  RIGHT CLICK \u2014 let go"
  - SectionId: 89308091
    EntryId: 27629657
    Key: howto.l6
    Value: The holding hand pulls you up by itself. Glowing rock = where you can
      grab.
  - SectionId: 89308091
    EntryId: 79449286
    Key: howto.l7
    Value: 'Don''t hang on one arm too long: arms redden, shake and let go!'
  - SectionId: 89308091
    EntryId: 25288826
    Key: howto.players
    Value: PLAYER SPLIT
  - SectionId: 89308091
    EntryId: 70488937
    Key: howto.p1
    Value: "1 \u2014 Octopus mode (4 limbs)"
  - SectionId: 89308091
    EntryId: 38118160
    Key: howto.p2
    Value: "2 \u2014 Cross link (arm + opposite leg)"
  - SectionId: 89308091
    EntryId: 40755791
    Key: howto.p3
    Value: "3 \u2014 Asymmetric (one gets both legs)"
  - SectionId: 89308091
    EntryId: 75718668
    Key: howto.p4
    Value: "4 \u2014 Total chaos (one limb each)"
